          "worked": "Place $D,H,S,C$ across the columns for the second draw and down the rows for the first draw. In each cell write (row suit, column suit), as in the short-answer array. Replacement makes all 16 ordered suit pairs possible and equally likely.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
